%>

<p class="govuk-body">
When an access token has expired you will be unable to use it to access the API.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
You will need to get a new access token by following the
<%= govuk_link_to("authorisation process", api_documentation_authentication_page_path("getting-an-oauth-access-token"), no_visited_state: true) %>
again to obtain a new one.
</p>

